    "collapsible_content_EkPUF": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_daXQK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_icon": "none",
            "title": "Which mat is best for muddy entrances?",
            "row_content": "<p>UltiScrape works best due to its stiff scraping fibres.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_PH8nb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_icon": "none",
            "title": "Are Ultimats safe for pets?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Ultimats are made using non-toxic, pet-safe materials and are suitable for everyday indoor use. They are designed to be low-odour and free from harmful emissions, ensuring a safe environment for your pets.</p><p>Additionally, by trapping dirt, dust, and debris at the entrance, they help keep your floors cleaner—creating a more hygienic space for pets to move around comfortably.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_GBXGW": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_icon": "none",
            "title": "Can these be used indoors?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Ultimats are designed for indoor as well as covered entrance use. They feature non-slip backing, low-odour materials, and a refined surface finish, making them well-suited for homes, offices, and indoor commercial spaces.</p><p>By effectively trapping dirt and moisture at the entry point, they help keep interior floors cleaner and safer.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_PAMtp": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "row_icon": "none",
            "title": "Are these washable?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Ultimats are designed for easy maintenance. Most mats can be vacuumed, brushed, or rinsed with water to remove accumulated dirt and debris.</p><p>For a deeper clean, they can be washed and air-dried, helping restore performance and keep them looking fresh over time.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
